{"seq":3,"slug":"operator-observability","title":"Operator 可观测性建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-observability","wordCount":933,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"operator-可观测性建设\">Operator 可观测性建设</h1><p>Operator 在生产集群中持续运行，管理关键业务的有状态基础设施。当 Operator 行为异常——调谐延迟飙升、错误率突增、队列深度积压——如果没有结构化的可观测性基础设施，SRE 团队只能在用户报告&quot;数据库不可用&quot;之后才被动响应。Operator 可观测性的目标是让运行时行为透明：从&quot;发生了什么&quot;（指标）、&quot;正在做什么&quot;（日志/追踪）、到&quot;是否健康&quot;（健康检查），构成完整的信号体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三支柱</strong>：Metrics（聚合趋势/告警）+ Logs（单次调谐上下文）+ Traces（跨组件调用链）</li>\n<li><strong>内置指标</strong>：controller-runtime 自动暴露 reconcile 延迟、错误率、队列深度等核心 Prometheus 指标</li>\n<li><strong>自定义业务指标</strong>：领域特定的 Gauge/Counter/Histogram（管理的实例数、failover 次数、备份耗时）</li>\n<li><strong>结构化日志</strong>：JSON 格式 + 上下文字段（namespace/name/generation），便于日志聚合系统解析</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查</strong>：<code>/healthz</code>（存活）+ <code>/readyz</code>（就绪），映射到 Pod 的 Liveness/Readiness Probe</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性三支柱在-operator-中的映射\">可观测性三支柱在 Operator 中的映射</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Metrics&#10;        M1[reconcile_duration_seconds]&#10;        M2[reconcile_errors_total]&#10;        M3[workqueue_depth]&#10;        M4[leader_election_status]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Logs&#10;        L1[结构化 JSON 日志]&#10;        L2[调谐入口/出口日志]&#10;        L3[错误上下文日志]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Traces&#10;        T1[调谐全链路 Span]&#10;        T2[外部 API 调用 Span]&#10;        T3[子资源操作 Span]&#10;    end&#10;    Metrics --&gt; D[Dashboard]&#10;    Logs --&gt; D&#10;    Traces --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Metrics\n        M1[reconcile_duration_seconds]\n        M2[reconcile_errors_total]\n        M3[workqueue_depth]\n        M4[leader_election_status]\n    end\n    subgraph Logs\n        L1[结构化 JSON 日志]\n        L2[调谐入口/出口日志]\n        L3[错误上下文日志]\n    end\n    subgraph Traces\n        T1[调谐全链路 Span]\n        T2[外部 API 调用 Span]\n        T3[子资源操作 Span]\n    end\n    Metrics --&gt; D[Dashboard]\n    Logs --&gt; D\n    Traces --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>Operator 中的价值</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Metrics</td>\n<td>聚合趋势、告警触发、容量规划</td>\n<td>Prometheus + Grafana</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Logs</td>\n<td>单次调谐的详细上下文、错误排障</td>\n<td>结构化 JSON + Loki/ELK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traces</td>\n<td>跨组件调用链、性能瓶颈定位</td>\n<td>OpenTelemetry + Jaeger/Tempo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"controller-runtime-内置指标\">controller-runtime 内置指标</h2><p>controller-runtime 自动暴露一组 Prometheus 指标，覆盖 Reconciler、Work Queue 和 Client 三个层面：</p>\n<h3 id=\"reconciler-指标\">Reconciler 指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>controller_runtime_reconcile_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>调谐总次数（按 controller, result）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller_runtime_reconcile_errors_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>调谐返回 error 的次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller_runtime_reconcile_time_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>调谐耗时分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller_runtime_max_concurrent_reconciles</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>最大并发调谐数配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller_runtime_active_workers</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>当前活跃的调谐 worker 数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"work-queue-指标\">Work Queue 指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_depth</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>队列当前深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_adds_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>入队总次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_queue_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>在队列中等待的时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_work_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>处理一个 item 的时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_retries_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>重试总次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_longest_running_processor_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>最长运行的处理器时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"client-指标\">Client 指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rest_client_requests_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>API Server 请求总次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rest_client_request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>API Server 请求延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自定义业务指标\">自定义业务指标</h2><p>除内置指标外，Operator 应暴露领域特定的业务指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var (&#10;    databasesTotal = prometheus.NewGaugeVec(&#10;        prometheus.GaugeOpts{&#10;            Name: &quot;operator_databases_total&quot;,&#10;            Help: &quot;Total number of managed Database instances by status&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;status&quot;},  // ready, degraded, failed&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    failoverTotal = prometheus.NewCounterVec(&#10;        prometheus.CounterOpts{&#10;            Name: &quot;operator_failovers_total&quot;,&#10;            Help: &quot;Total number of automatic failovers performed&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;database&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;},&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    backupDurationSeconds = prometheus.NewHistogramVec(&#10;        prometheus.HistogramOpts{&#10;            Name:    &quot;operator_backup_duration_seconds&quot;,&#10;            Help:    &quot;Time taken to complete database backups&quot;,&#10;            Buckets: []float64{10, 30, 60, 120, 300, 600},&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;database&quot;, &quot;type&quot;},  // full, incremental&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;&#10;func init() {&#10;    metrics.Registry.MustRegister(&#10;        databasesTotal,&#10;        failoverTotal,&#10;        backupDurationSeconds,&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    databasesTotal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prometheus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewGaugeVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GaugeOpts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"operator_databases_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Help: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Total number of managed Database instances by status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ready, degraded, failed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    failoverTotal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prometheus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewCounterVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CounterOpts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"operator_failovers_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Help: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Total number of automatic failovers performed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backupDurationSeconds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prometheus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewHistogramVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HistogramOpts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Name:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"operator_backup_duration_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Help:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Time taken to complete database backups\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Buckets: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// full, incremental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics.Registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MustRegister</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        databasesTotal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        failoverTotal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        backupDurationSeconds,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"结构化日志\">结构化日志</h2><p>controller-runtime 使用 <code>logr</code> 接口实现结构化日志。生产环境应配置 JSON 输出格式，便于日志聚合系统解析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/log/zap&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;// main.go 中配置日志&#10;opts := zap.Options{&#10;    Development: false,  // 生产模式：JSON 格式&#10;    Level:       zapcore.InfoLevel,&#10;}&#10;ctrl.SetLogger(zap.New(zap.UseFlagOptions(&amp;opts)))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/log/zap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.go 中配置日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">opts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> zap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Development: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产模式：JSON 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Level:       zapcore.InfoLevel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctrl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetLogger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(zap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(zap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UseFlagOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">opts)))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>日志级别约定</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Error</td>\n<td>调谐失败，需要人工关注</td>\n<td>&quot;failed to create StatefulSet&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Info (V=0)</td>\n<td>重要状态变更</td>\n<td>&quot;database became ready&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Debug (V=1)</td>\n<td>调谐入口/出口</td>\n<td>&quot;reconciling database&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace (V=2)</td>\n<td>详细内部状态</td>\n<td>&quot;comparing spec vs actual replicas&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>上下文字段</strong>：每条日志应包含足够的上下文供排障：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"log := ctrl.LoggerFrom(ctx)&#10;log.Info(&quot;reconciling database&quot;,&#10;    &quot;namespace&quot;, db.Namespace,&#10;    &quot;name&quot;, db.Name,&#10;    &quot;generation&quot;, db.Generation,&#10;    &quot;replicas&quot;, db.Spec.Replicas,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">log </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctrl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LoggerFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reconciling database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Namespace,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"generation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Generation,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"replicas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Spec.Replicas,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"健康检查端点\">健康检查端点</h2><p>controller-runtime Manager 自动暴露两个健康检查端点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 注册健康检查&#10;mgr.AddHealthzCheck(&quot;healthz&quot;, healthz.Ping)&#10;mgr.AddReadyzCheck(&quot;readyz&quot;, healthz.Ping)&#10;&#10;// 自定义就绪检查：验证 Cache 是否已同步&#10;mgr.AddReadyzCheck(&quot;informer-sync&quot;, func(req *http.Request) error {&#10;    if !mgr.GetCache().WaitForCacheSync(req.Context()) {&#10;        return fmt.Errorf(&quot;informers not synced&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;    return nil&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注册健康检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddHealthzCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"healthz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, healthz.Ping)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddReadyzCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"readyz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, healthz.Ping)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义就绪检查：验证 Cache 是否已同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddReadyzCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"informer-sync\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitForCacheSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Errorf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"informers not synced\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>端点</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>Kubernetes 映射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>/healthz</code></td>\n<td>进程是否存活</td>\n<td><code>livenessProbe</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/readyz</code></td>\n<td>是否准备好接受工作</td>\n<td><code>readinessProbe</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>探针配置最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"livenessProbe:&#10;  httpGet:&#10;    path: /healthz&#10;    port: 8081&#10;  initialDelaySeconds: 15&#10;  periodSeconds: 20&#10;  failureThreshold: 3&#10;&#10;readinessProbe:&#10;  httpGet:&#10;    path: /readyz&#10;    port: 8081&#10;  initialDelaySeconds: 5&#10;  periodSeconds: 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">livenessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/healthz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8081</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  failureThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">readinessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/readyz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8081</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"告警规则设计\">告警规则设计</h2><p>基于 Operator 指标的 Prometheus 告警规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: operator-alerts&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: OperatorReconcileErrorRate&#10;        expr: |&#10;          rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_errors_total[5m]) &#10;          / rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total[5m]) &gt; 0.1&#10;        for: 10m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Operator 调谐错误率超过 10%&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: OperatorQueueSaturation&#10;        expr: workqueue_depth &gt; 100&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;调谐队列积压超过 100，Operator 处理能力不足&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: OperatorReconcileLatency&#10;        expr: |&#10;          histogram_quantile(0.99, &#10;            rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_time_seconds_bucket[5m])&#10;          ) &gt; 30&#10;        for: 10m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;P99 调谐延迟超过 30 秒&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: OperatorLeaderLost&#10;        expr: |&#10;          changes(leader_election_master_status[5m]) &gt; 2&#10;        for: 1m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Leader Election 频繁切换，可能存在稳定性问题&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">operator-alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OperatorReconcileErrorRate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_errors_total[5m]) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          / rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total[5m]) > 0.1