e=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Leader Election 频繁切换，可能存在稳定性问题'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"grafana-dashboard-核心面板\">Grafana Dashboard 核心面板</h2><p>一个生产级 Operator Dashboard 应包含以下核心面板：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 概览行&#10;        A1[管理的 CR 总数] --- A2[Ready 比例] --- A3[活跃 Reconcile 数]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 性能行&#10;        B1[Reconcile 延迟 P50/P95/P99]&#10;        B2[Queue 深度趋势]&#10;        B3[API Server 请求延迟]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 错误行&#10;        C1[Reconcile Error Rate]&#10;        C2[API 4xx/5xx 比例]&#10;        C3[Requeue 频率]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 资源行&#10;        D1[CPU/Memory 使用]&#10;        D2[Goroutine 数]&#10;        D3[GC 暂停时间]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 概览行\n        A1[管理的 CR 总数] --- A2[Ready 比例] --- A3[活跃 Reconcile 数]\n    end\n    subgraph 性能行\n        B1[Reconcile 延迟 P50/P95/P99]\n        B2[Queue 深度趋势]\n        B3[API Server 请求延迟]\n    end\n    subgraph 错误行\n        C1[Reconcile Error Rate]\n        C2[API 4xx/5xx 比例]\n        C3[Requeue 频率]\n    end\n    subgraph 资源行\n        D1[CPU/Memory 使用]\n        D2[Goroutine 数]\n        D3[GC 暂停时间]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"opentelemetry-集成\">OpenTelemetry 集成</h2><p>对于需要端到端追踪的场景（如调谐过程中调用外部 API），可以集成 OpenTelemetry：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel&quot;&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func (r *Reconciler) Reconcile(ctx context.Context, req ctrl.Request) (ctrl.Result, error) {&#10;    tracer := otel.Tracer(&quot;database-operator&quot;)&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;Reconcile&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;database&quot;, req.Name),&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;namespace&quot;, req.Namespace),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    // 子 Span：外部 API 调用&#10;    ctx, childSpan := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;CreateCloudDatabase&quot;)&#10;    err := r.cloudProvider.CreateInstance(ctx, ...)&#10;    childSpan.End()&#10;&#10;    return ctrl.Result{}, err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconciler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database-operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Reconcile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, req.Name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, req.Namespace),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 子 Span：外部 API 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, childSpan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CreateCloudDatabase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.cloudProvider.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CreateInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    childSpan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Operator 可观测性建设覆盖三个维度：Metrics 提供聚合趋势与告警能力（controller-runtime 内置 + 自定义业务指标）、Logs 提供单次调谐的详细上下文（结构化 JSON + 分级输出）、Traces 提供跨组件调用链追踪（OpenTelemetry 集成）。健康检查端点映射到 Kubernetes 探针保证 Pod 生命周期正确。告警规则应覆盖错误率、队列积压、调谐延迟和 Leader Election 抖动四个关键维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"operator-testing\">Operator 测试策略与实践</a>——测试中验证可观测性信号的正确性</li>\n<li><a href=\"operator-lifecycle-manager\">Operator Lifecycle Manager</a>——部署后的运维监控需求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Operator 可观测性建设","id":"operator-可观测性建设"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性三支柱在 Operator 中的映射","id":"可观测性三支柱在-operator-中的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"controller-runtime 内置指标","id":"controller-runtime-内置指标"},{"level":3,"text":"Reconciler 指标","id":"reconciler-指标"},{"level":3,"text":"Work Queue 指标","id":"work-queue-指标"},{"level":3,"text":"Client 指标","id":"client-指标"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义业务指标","id":"自定义业务指标"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化日志","id":"结构化日志"},{"level":2,"text":"健康检查端点","id":"健康检查端点"},{"level":2,"text":"告警规则设计","id":"告警规则设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Grafana Dashboard 核心面板","id":"grafana-dashboard-核心面板"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry 集成","id":"opentelemetry-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Operator Lifecycle Manager 与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-lifecycle-manager"},"next":null}